==Battleground==
*3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s (100%) spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gabriel]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns.
**3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Gabriel]]s (100%) spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**4 [[HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cat (Enemy)|HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cats]] spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|Anti-Angel Cats]] can deal with this stage pretty easily. Just like the [[Weiwuying|previous stage]], be cautious, as [[HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cat (Enemy)|HAPPI &amp; Maji Cat &amp; Cat]] has '''300,000 HP'''.  If you're unable to beat this stage, but you are able to beat the [[Weiwuying|previous stage]], then it's better off to get the true form there as it has a 50% chance to drop.

